window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The last Box Set in NYT Bestselling Author, Susan Stoker’s, SEAL of Protection series includes three exciting stand-alone novels, including a recent bestseller hit.</b></p> <p>You get a silver fox, aliens, suspense, forced proximity, and a couple on the run from danger in <i>Protecting Dakota</i>, but you also get a glimpse of the next generation in <i>Protecting Alabama’s Kids</i>. And in <i>Protecting Tex</i> the resident computer genius faces his own demons in this thriller complete with our hero being kidnapped and his military friends from across Stoker’s expansive catalog having to band together to rescue him. Alpha males, military, Green berets, strong heroines, all come together to prove their loyalty to the man who has always had their backs.</p>"; 
